      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- make cookie service a separate microservice:\nwhen cookies are unusable but in status usable call\nthe main service sets cookies to retrieving and notifies\ncookie service. cookie service tried to fetch new\ncookies, if success set new cookies in redis and change\nstatus to usable. if not set cookies to expired\n\n- implement queue for request:\nmake some logic with queue that eg the app can process\n4 download requests at once and if 5th comes, it should\nwait until other ones are completed\n\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- make cookie service a separate microservice:\nwhen cookies are unusable but in status usable call\nthe main service sets cookies to retrieving and notifies\ncookie service. cookie service tried to fetch new\ncookies, if success set new cookies in redis and change\nstatus to usable. if not set cookies to expired\n\n- implement queue for request:\nmake some logic with queue that eg the app can process\n4 download requests at once and if 5th comes, it should\nwait until other ones are completed\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
